WEBVTT

00:25:28.876 --> 00:25:31.796
But you must not go to the fake news sites

00:25:31.836 --> 00:25:33.796
and believe that that's the truth.

00:25:33.836 --> 00:25:35.556
You must go to what I would call

00:25:35.596 --> 00:25:38.276
the news organizations that have earned

00:25:38.316 --> 00:25:42.196
the Good Housekeeping seal
of authenticity and truth

00:25:42.236 --> 00:25:45.196
and, you know, approval.

00:25:46.116 --> 00:25:49.556
It's really on you all now
to search for those.

00:25:49.596 --> 00:25:51.476
And it's not hard, they exist.

00:25:52.996 --> 00:25:55.076
WPR: As we get close
to the end of our time,

00:25:55.116 --> 00:25:57.276
I just want to turn things
to you, Christiane,

00:25:57.316 --> 00:26:01.196
and your thinking
as a reporter, a journalist.